{"author":"chadbailey59","body":"This is an interesting idea. I don't think we want to replace all of the existing LLM services right away, as the devil is often in the details with abstraction layers like this. But we could definitely build a `LiteLLMService` that sits alongside existing services, and use that as a proving ground of sorts.","createdAt":"2025-03-10T19:33:15Z"}
{"author":"danthegoodman1","body":"Yes definitely, I think just as an option solves it for us.\n\nThe problem is not the different LLm processors, it all the different formats they expect","createdAt":"2025-03-10T19:34:55Z"}
{"author":"arpan-reconectai","body":"Yes, this will be extremely useful for us. We are deploying newer open source model with vllm, which litellm exposes as OpenAI compatible APIs. Having Litellm integration (in pipecat and pipecat flows) will allow us to switch models and test easily.","createdAt":"2025-03-18T15:02:15Z"}
{"author":"kkarkos","body":"Need this for Spend Tracking https://docs.litellm.ai/docs/proxy/cost_tracking","createdAt":"2025-08-13T02:24:38Z"}
{"author":"anotine10","body":"Is it something that is going to enter in roadmap? \nIt would be very interesting, especially to add some routing and fallback capacity based on extensive strategy (errors, latency, token consumption)","createdAt":"2025-10-21T15:21:58Z"}
{"author":"markbackman","body":"We are definitely interested in this but time hasn't permitted just yet. If anyone is interested, we're happy to collaborate on this.","createdAt":"2025-11-06T21:27:21Z"}
{"author":"shubhamofbce","body":"@markbackman I am thinking to start with this as I am already familiar with LiteLLM. Just checking If your team is already working on this?","createdAt":"2025-11-10T19:56:30Z"}
{"author":"markbackman","body":"@shubhamofbce we aren't working on this. LLMs in Pipecat are quite complex and require a good understanding of how Pipecat works. If you decide to work on this, please look at other LLM services and the context aggregators as a reference.","createdAt":"2025-11-10T20:01:14Z"}
{"author":"shiv-upstart","body":"@markbackman we at Upstart would be interested in this as well. Happy to collaborate on this one.","createdAt":"2026-01-27T18:47:16Z"}
{"author":"markbackman","body":"@shiv-upstart good to know. We're interested, but our resourcing is unlikely to provide time in the near future. If someone on your team is interested in making a contribution to the project, we'd be happy to review and then maintain.","createdAt":"2026-01-28T01:14:22Z"}
{"author":"markbackman","body":"Given current events, I'm glad we didn't take this up 😬 ","createdAt":"2026-03-26T03:42:27Z"}
